{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1161.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"e4cda8d0f657cd8b7b59938470b7eeef2f5bfe6218a10e70465ff2279023ebe4","ja":"地方営業を終えた未来、静香、恵美の3人は\n宿泊先のホテルに向かっていて……","zh":"结束地方演出的未来、静香、惠美3人\n正前往下榻的酒店……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1161.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"5040effddc0402c875956d977faa169e0e38c4245ae5b485279d7112c2c2f225","ja":"お仕事楽しかったな～♪\nこの間の公演の話、いっぱいできてよかったね！","zh":"工作好开心啊～♪\n能聊很多上次公演的事真是太好啦！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1161.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"6b7aa852779e2bd89cb2488728d5fb44019a74436b01e5b0a953db166443931a","ja":"ええ。それに、今度の武道館公演についても、\nいい宣伝ができたんじゃないかしら？","zh":"嗯。而且，这也算为接下来的武道馆公演\n做了一次很好的宣传吧？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1161.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"f9c3d05f9b2a38d41064487e6c9401eb733c095a3425033936cb60a096ccd0b7","ja":"うん、アタシたちがどれくらい武道館公演に\nかけているか、伝わったと思うよ♪","zh":"嗯，我想大家一定感受到了\n我们对武道馆公演倾注了多少心血♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1161.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"ee4effa3321f12b0720b5839c4ee2e119cba800b8c063061546550b1c80f6c83","ja":"えへへっ♪　みんな待ちきれなくって、\nいっぱいレッスン頑張ってるもんね♪","zh":"嘿嘿♪ 毕竟大家都等不及了，\n都在非常努力地练习嘛♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1161.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"4d9803deae1cf209f37af6399d47e6b58474332f985b01d293e9574fd4a555b9","ja":"考えたらウキウキしてきちゃった！\n私、まだホテルに帰りたくないかも！","zh":"光是想想就兴奋起来了！\n我可能还不想回酒店呢！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1161.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"81a358fecfc54d6e94323d816c5ee1d533c23f039e457cd9f4f34776ac490681","ja":"えっ！？　何言ってるの、未来。\nもう遅いんだし、早く帰らないと。","zh":"咦！？你在说什么呢，未来。\n已经很晚了，得赶紧回家才行。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1161.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"03cb812998d3a3fcea60824e7d7b9ed97c21e7d7435175ff37e42786deb41e1a","ja":"にゃはは♪　でもアタシも未来の気持ちわかるな！\nこのままじゃソワソワして眠れないかも！","zh":"喵哈哈♪ 不过我也能理解未来的心情呢！\n这样下去可能会兴奋得睡不着觉哦！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1161.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"3a8cb057da135fe9bef267e1091c245766ef36113f00e09832c3040c8708f5e4","ja":"ちょっと散歩するくらいならいいんじゃない？\n一応、●●●●プロデューサーには話しておいてさ。","zh":"只是稍微散散步的话应该没问题吧？\n不过还是先跟●●●●制作人说一声吧。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1161.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"4b50ba6f400aad50065eab4d4384da84435b2fc97465b1b7053119951120f2cc","ja":"わーい！　それじゃあまずは\n●●●●プロデューサーさんに電話してみますね♪","zh":"太好啦！那我首先\n给●●●●制作人打电话试试看哦♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1161.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"cdb3975620145cdff5252f0cdab92ceda2a73cf18573780e2385d95b9d6416d4","ja":"恵美さんまで……\nもう、本当にちょっとだけだからね！","zh":"惠美也真是的……\n真是的，真的就只有一点点哦！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
